# game.mcscript — a little adventure written in Verbum.

when player joins
    welcome player with Welcome to the server

when player dies
    tell player Better luck next time

when player touches water
    kill player

when player breaks diamond ore
    add 10 to player's coins

when player reaches area castle
    open castle gate

when player has 100 coins
    give player diamond sword
    tell player You are now a champion
